  "CASTAWAY": "NAUFRAGÉ",
  "Castilian sails brought Sultan al-Mansur promises. Your family accepted their drafts as though promises were silver.": "Les voiles castillanes apportèrent les promesses du sultan al-Mansur. Votre famille a accepté leurs traites comme si les promesses étaient de l'argent.",
  "Catch {0} x{1}": "Attrapez {0} x{1}",
